    "type": "game",
    "name": "Atelier Resleriana: The Red Alchemist & the White Guardian",
    "steam_appid": 3259600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong>A boy and girl return to their lost hometown in search of truth and to bring back what they hold dear.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>The town of Hallfein once rested on the border between three provinces, prospering thanks to mining and trade.<br>However, a mysterious tragedy struck the peaceful town, and most of its residents completely vanished.<br>Hallfein became a restricted area, and access was forbidden to all except investigators from the capital.<br><br>Years passed, and the restrictions were eventually lifted, after which plans to restore the town were put together. Taking this opportunity, a young man and woman follow their hearts and return to Hallfein after being forced to leave it so long ago; the young woman wanting to restore the shop previously run by her missing grandfather, and the young man hoping to learn more about the items left to him by his departed father. They both also seek to learn why the town's residents vanished that day.<br><br>The two will meet and set out on a journey in search of the truth together. However, neither could imagine just what would await them on that journey.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/c4e959f3f9c92882bdcabf96fb2a7af8.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Field</h2>Like Atelier Resleriana, this adventure takes place in the continent of Lantarna.<br><br>You can take control of the characters to explore the fields firsthand.<br>Differences between day and night and changes with the weather that weren't able to be fully included in Atelier Resleriana can now be enjoyed during your adventure.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/2a8d2bac1401af49267d7b9f407d8253.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2>This game inherits the tactical timeline battle system from Atelier Resleriana.<br>Up to three party members can be placed on both the front and back rows. Enjoy fighting as one united force, and utilize new elements such as Multi-actions, Item Mix, and Link Attacks to add even more excitement to battles.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/35f17475c118d57f54e928712133550f.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synthesis</h2>The synthesis in this came is called &quot;Gift Color Synthesis,&quot; and involves linking the different colors that ingredients possess in order to create items. Items can be strengthened even further by synthesizing along with your allies. Up to three additional ingredients can also be added in order to pass along traits, allowing for simple yet intricate synthesis!<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/c3bc648713872a50bdd752ba80d3c106.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Town Development &amp; Shop Management</h2>You can sell the items you've synthesized in your shop in order to develop the town! Earn money by selling a variety of items, and use that money in order to invest in the town's development. As the town develops, you'll obtain new synthesis recipes and unlock new parts of the main story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2>Rias Eidreise (Hina Tachibana)<br>Slade Clauslyter (Toki Shunichi)<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/10335a46ce4a9f50110f1c26a033159f.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/90637b0547e2037dc1188a40063100c6.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><br><strong>Characters from previous Atelier series games will also join your party!</strong><br>Razeluxe Meitzen<br>Totooria Helmold<br>Wilbell Voll-Ersleid<br>Sophie Neuenmuller<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/5cc76e75b49630f223fa8e068a097254.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/0478881211da0f115277ebecc8824347.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/34ed619e906d27806e8bc9c527dce072.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/7bf617aeeef11ea719c72e60f592199c.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A boy and girl return to their lost hometown in search of truth and to bring back what they hold dear.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>The town of Hallfein once rested on the border between three provinces, prospering thanks to mining and trade.<br>However, a mysterious tragedy struck the peaceful town, and most of its residents completely vanished.<br>Hallfein became a restricted area, and access was forbidden to all except investigators from the capital.<br><br>Years passed, and the restrictions were eventually lifted, after which plans to restore the town were put together. Taking this opportunity, a young man and woman follow their hearts and return to Hallfein after being forced to leave it so long ago; the young woman wanting to restore the shop previously run by her missing grandfather, and the young man hoping to learn more about the items left to him by his departed father. They both also seek to learn why the town's residents vanished that day.<br><br>The two will meet and set out on a journey in search of the truth together. However, neither could imagine just what would await them on that journey.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/c4e959f3f9c92882bdcabf96fb2a7af8.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Field</h2>Like Atelier Resleriana, this adventure takes place in the continent of Lantarna.<br><br>You can take control of the characters to explore the fields firsthand.<br>Differences between day and night and changes with the weather that weren't able to be fully included in Atelier Resleriana can now be enjoyed during your adventure.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/2a8d2bac1401af49267d7b9f407d8253.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2>This game inherits the tactical timeline battle system from Atelier Resleriana.<br>Up to three party members can be placed on both the front and back rows. Enjoy fighting as one united force, and utilize new elements such as Multi-actions, Item Mix, and Link Attacks to add even more excitement to battles.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/35f17475c118d57f54e928712133550f.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synthesis</h2>The synthesis in this came is called &quot;Gift Color Synthesis,&quot; and involves linking the different colors that ingredients possess in order to create items. Items can be strengthened even further by synthesizing along with your allies. Up to three additional ingredients can also be added in order to pass along traits, allowing for simple yet intricate synthesis!<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/c3bc648713872a50bdd752ba80d3c106.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Town Development &amp; Shop Management</h2>You can sell the items you've synthesized in your shop in order to develop the town! Earn money by selling a variety of items, and use that money in order to invest in the town's development. As the town develops, you'll obtain new synthesis recipes and unlock new parts of the main story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2>Rias Eidreise (Hina Tachibana)<br>Slade Clauslyter (Toki Shunichi)<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/10335a46ce4a9f50110f1c26a033159f.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/90637b0547e2037dc1188a40063100c6.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><br><strong>Characters from previous Atelier series games will also join your party!</strong><br>Razeluxe Meitzen<br>Totooria Helmold<br>Wilbell Voll-Ersleid<br>Sophie Neuenmuller<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/5cc76e75b49630f223fa8e068a097254.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/0478881211da0f115277ebecc8824347.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/34ed619e906d27806e8bc9c527dce072.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259600/extras/7bf617aeeef11ea719c72e60f592199c.avif?t=1753676542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
